Quest 546 "[Failed Mission] Attack of Barbarians"
    Journal for karus "You must talk to an [Ascetic] Veda, of Eslant."
    Journal for elmorad "You must talk to an [Ascetic] Tabeth, of Eslant."

Requires player level >= 63

Rewards none

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "Master! Find [Ascetic] Beda in Eslant!"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Master! Find [Ascetics] Tabeth on Eslant!"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "are you <selfname>? Welcome"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Eslant here recently had a sugar content messenger of the King-Tropez. Tell me the story was concerned that worked for the conquest of the barbarian troops attacked and destroyed.\n\nStart conversation with [Ascetic] Beda about missing Unit."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "<selfname>? Come on."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Eslant here recently had a sugar content messenger of the King-Tropez. Tell me the story was concerned that worked for the conquest of the barbarian troops attacked and destroyed.\n\nStart conversation with [Ascetic] Beda about missing Unit."

On claimable
    If player is karus
        Show quest "So enshrined by <selfname>, lo Been destroyed, let me find a trace of the bag. Would you like to ask to protect you if you have Survivors.\n\nThe bag was missing from the the Eslant updated snow-capped southwest y'know"
    If player is elmorad
        Show quest "So enshrined by <selfname>, lo Been destroyed, let me find a trace of the bag. Would you like to ask to protect you if you have Survivors.\n\nThe bag was missing from the the Eslant updated snow-capped southwest y'know."
